{"title":"Mark and sweep","sub":"Find everything reachable from the roots; everything else is garbage.","kind":"graph","interval":1500,"legend":[["c","roots"],["b","marking now"],["good","live"],["bad","garbage, freed"]],"graph":{"w":620,"h":250,"r":27,"nodes":[{"id":"stack","x":70,"y":50},{"id":"globals","x":70,"y":190},{"id":"A","x":210,"y":50},{"id":"B","x":350,"y":30},{"id":"C","x":350,"y":120},{"id":"D","x":210,"y":190},{"id":"E","x":490,"y":70},{"id":"F","x":430,"y":210},{"id":"G","x":560,"y":210},{"id":"H","x":500,"y":140}],"edges":[{"u":"stack","v":"A","dir":true},{"u":"A","v":"B","dir":true},{"u":"A","v":"C","dir":true},{"u":"C","v":"E","dir":true},{"u":"globals","v":"D","dir":true},{"u":"F","v":"G","dir":true},{"u":"G","v":"H","dir":true},{"u":"H","v":"F","dir":true}]},"frames":[{"caption":"Objects on the heap and the references between them. Roots (aqua) are what the program can reach directly: the stack and globals. F, G and H refer to each other in a cycle, but nothing else refers to them.","nodes":{"stack":{"cls":"c"},"globals":{"cls":"c"}},"edges":{"stack-A":"muted","A-B":"muted","A-C":"muted","C-E":"muted","globals-D":"muted","F-G":"muted","G-H":"muted","H-F":"muted"},"stats":[["Marked live",0],["Freed",0]]},{"caption":"<b>Mark</b>: A is reachable from a root, so it's live.","nodes":{"stack":{"cls":"c"},"globals":{"cls":"c"},"A":{"cls":"b"}},"edges":{"stack-A":"good","A-B":"muted","A-C":"muted","C-E":"muted","globals-D":"muted","F-G":"muted","G-H":"muted","H-F":"muted"},"stats":[["Marked live",1],["Freed",0]]},{"caption":"<b>Mark</b>: B is reachable from a root, so it's live.","nodes":{"stack":{"cls":"c"},"globals":{"cls":"c"},"A":{"cls":"good"},"B":{"cls":"b"}},"edges":{"stack-A":"good","A-B":"good","A-C":"muted","C-E":"muted","globals-D":"muted","F-G":"muted","G-H":"muted","H-F":"muted"},"stats":[["Marked live",2],["Freed",0]]},{"caption":"<b>Mark</b>: C is reachable from a root, so it's live.","nodes":{"stack":{"cls":"c"},"globals":{"cls":"c"},"A":{"cls":"good"},"B":{"cls":"good"},"C":{"cls":"b"}},"edges":{"stack-A":"good","A-B":"good","A-C":"good","C-E":"muted","globals-D":"muted","F-G":"muted","G-H":"muted","H-F":"muted"},"stats":[["Marked live",3],["Freed",0]]},{"caption":"<b>Mark</b>: E is reachable from a root, so it's live.","nodes":{"stack":{"cls":"c"},"globals":{"cls":"c"},"A":{"cls":"good"},"B":{"cls":"good"},"C":{"cls":"good"},"E":{"cls":"b"}},"edges":{"stack-A":"good","A-B":"good","A-C":"good","C-E":"good","globals-D":"muted","F-G":"muted","G-H":"muted","H-F":"muted"},"stats":[["Marked live",4],["Freed",0]]},{"caption":"<b>Mark</b>: D is reachable from a root, so it's live.","nodes":{"stack":{"cls":"c"},"globals":{"cls":"c"},"A":{"cls":"good"},"B":{"cls":"good"},"C":{"cls":"good"},"D":{"cls":"b"},"E":{"cls":"good"}},"edges":{"stack-A":"good","A-B":"good","A-C":"good","C-E":"good","globals-D":"good","F-G":"muted","G-H":"muted","H-F":"muted"},"stats":[["Marked live",5],["Freed",0]]},{"caption":"Marking is done. Anything not marked is unreachable: no sequence of references from the program can ever get to it.","nodes":{"stack":{"cls":"c"},"globals":{"cls":"c"},"A":{"cls":"good"},"B":{"cls":"good"},"C":{"cls":"good"},"D":{"cls":"good"},"E":{"cls":"good"}},"edges":{"stack-A":"good","A-B":"good","A-C":"good","C-E":"good","globals-D":"good","F-G":"muted","G-H":"muted","H-F":"muted"},"stats":[["Marked live",5],["Freed",0]]},{"caption":"<b>Sweep</b>: free every unmarked object: F, G and H. Reference counting alone could never free them, because each still has a reference from another member of the cycle. Tracing GC doesn't care.","nodes":{"stack":{"cls":"c"},"globals":{"cls":"c"},"A":{"cls":"good"},"B":{"cls":"good"},"C":{"cls":"good"},"D":{"cls":"good"},"E":{"cls":"good"},"F":{"cls":"bad"},"G":{"cls":"bad"},"H":{"cls":"bad"}},"edges":{"stack-A":"good","A-B":"good","A-C":"good","C-E":"good","globals-D":"good","F-G":"bad","G-H":"bad","H-F":"bad"},"stats":[["Marked live",5],["Freed",3]]}]}